{
  "id": "its-always-sunny-in-philadelphia---13x08---charlies-home-alone",
  "title": "It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia - 13x08 - Charlie's Home Alone",
  "sourceFilename": "It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia - 13x08 - Charlie's Home Alone.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-20T06:02:01.587Z",
  "lineCount": 290,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Where is it? It was right here. _",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 3003,
      "endMs": 4703
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "I cannot find it. And by the way, Mac, _",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 4838,
      "endMs": 6772
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "what're you even talking about? _ The word is superstition, not \"stupid-stition.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 6774,
      "endMs": 10441
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "I know what the word is, Charlie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 10477,
      "endMs": 12443
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "I'm saying your green man suit is a stupid superstition.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 12479,
      "endMs": 16381
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Oh, really? Then why do the Eagles keep winning?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 16383,
      "endMs": 18934
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Also, by the way, dude, uh, you're a Cowboys fan, so shut the hell up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 18936,
      "endMs": 22404
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "I'm not a Cowboy fan, I'm a Tony Romo fan.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 22406,
      "endMs": 23805
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "And he retired, so now I bleed green.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 23940,
      "endMs": 25340
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Go, Birds! Go, Birds! All right, well, I'm not going to the Super Bowl without it. I got to find it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 25409,
      "endMs": 28477
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Yeah, don't make us late, Charlie, all right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 28612,
      "endMs": 30412
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "I-If you can't find it, you can't find it, you know?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 30414,
      "endMs": 32414
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "The-the fans have no effect on the outcome of the game, anyway.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 32416,
      "endMs": 34566
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Do you know how football works? Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 34635,
      "endMs": 36368
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "That's right, your voodoo bullshit is not gonna mean anything if...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 36503,
      "endMs": 39237
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Wh-What's going on with your eye?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 39239,
      "endMs": 40705
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Uh, nothing, I got a, I think I got an eyelash in it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 40774,
      "endMs": 42574
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Well, you're, like, scratching it, and it's blinking.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 42643,
      "endMs": 44576
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "I just, I slept on it funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 44578,
      "endMs": 46178
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "What the hell is the holdup here?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 46180,
      "endMs": 47912
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Frank, this is why I wanted total control over the guest list, all right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 47981,
      "endMs": 51600
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "The eyes of the world are gonna be on Philadelphia, and I want to show them that we are not just degenerates, okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 51735,
      "endMs": 57672
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "And that is why I'm very nervous about these guys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 57675,
      "endMs": 60875
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Chug! Chug! Chug!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 61484,
      "endMs": 62778
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Chug! Chug! Chug!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 62880,
      "endMs": 63879
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Hey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 64014,
      "endMs": 65280
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Chug! Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 65282,
      "endMs": 66481
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Do me a favor, hold that corner right there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 66483,
      "endMs": 68566
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "What's this? Uh, I got to put up a sign.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 68602,
      "endMs": 70769
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "I want people to know we're closed for salmonella because of the Super Bowl.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 70771,
      "endMs": 74839
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Okay. First of all, how is \"salmonella\" the only word you spelled correctly?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 74875,
      "endMs": 79644
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "And second of all, which is it? Are we closed for salmonella, or are we closed 'cause of the Super Bowl? It's very confusing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 79680,
      "endMs": 83581
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Look, do me a favor? Okay? Just go find green man. Yep.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 83650,
      "endMs": 85734
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Please? Please, thank you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 85803,
      "endMs": 88536
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Charlie. Here, eat this asparagus. What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 88605,
      "endMs": 90739
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "No, I can't eat that right now. That-That's not right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 90874,
      "endMs": 92274
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "It's not part of my rituals.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 92276,
      "endMs": 93408
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Okay, do you know what's not right... is that we are trying to start a family,",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 93543,
      "endMs": 97011
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "and you're not taking it very seriously. Okay, no, I hear you, but what I need to take seriously right now is the Super Bowl, okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 97047,
      "endMs": 101966
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "And that means sticking to my color system.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 102002,
      "endMs": 103568
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "All right? I wear green. I don't eat it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 103703,
      "endMs": 105837
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "I'm green man. I eat brown, preferably, uh, milksteak with a little light char to it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 105972,
      "endMs": 109975
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "And I drink yellow, because beer is yellow, and that is what has been working all season long!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 110110,
      "endMs": 113845
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Oh, my God. I don't want to talk about this right now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113881,
      "endMs": 115980
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. Where're you going? Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 116016,
      "endMs": 117933
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Got to find green man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 117935,
      "endMs": 119000
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Why does no one understand this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 119069,
      "endMs": 120524
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Nobody cares about your stupid superstitions.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 120704,
      "endMs": 123138
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Dude, just get off my back, all right? Let me find it. No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123207,
      "endMs": 125140
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Man, look, I just wish one time you would not make everything so difficult.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 125209,
      "endMs": 129811
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Yeah, and you know what?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 129880,
      "endMs": 131129
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Sometimes I wish you'd just disappear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 131247,
      "endMs": 132680
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Yo, check it out. I got one last surprise.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 133452,
      "endMs": 136634
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "This is very nice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 142173,
      "endMs": 143842
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Party bus!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 143844,
      "endMs": 145911
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "No way. Fully stocked.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 146046,
      "endMs": 147846
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "There it is! You found it! - MAC: All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 151552,
      "endMs": 153401
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "You found the damn suit. Can we go now? Nice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 153537,
      "endMs": 155470
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Where the hell is green man?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 155539,
      "endMs": 157639
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Where is it?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159891,
      "endMs": 160742
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Well, I just can't find it, so I'm gonna have to, like, buy a new one on the way up there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 162679,
      "endMs": 166348
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Who knows if it's even gonna have the same powers as the other one did. I...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 166483,
      "endMs": 169434
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Where is everybody?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 170571,
      "endMs": 172437
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Guys?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 173017,
      "endMs": 174372
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "_",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 175843,
      "endMs": 178718
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Honey?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 203036,
      "endMs": 205303
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Hello?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 205305,
      "endMs": 207639
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Mac?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 208742,
      "endMs": 210842
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Dee?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 210977,
      "endMs": 213244
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Frank?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 213280,
      "endMs": 215213
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "I made my friends disappear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 217968,
      "endMs": 220936
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "I made my friends disappear!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 222072,
      "endMs": 225807
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Hey, Frank!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 241041,
      "endMs": 242774
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "I'm going through your stuff!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 242909,
      "endMs": 246311
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Hey, Mac!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 251501,
      "endMs": 252867
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "I'm going through your stuff!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 252936,
      "endMs": 255337
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "I got your... sticky Bible!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 256398,
      "endMs": 260007
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Dee!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 260043,
      "endMs": 261943
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "I'm going through your stuff!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 261945,
      "endMs": 264011
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Dee, woof!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 266016,
      "endMs": 268567
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "I don't know why I'm screaming. This doesn't hurt at all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 279913,
      "endMs": 282414
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Countdown to the game. And start the clock.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 284617,
      "endMs": 287602
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "E-A-G-L-E-S!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 287604,
      "endMs": 290405
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Eagles! All right, boys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 290407,
      "endMs": 293074
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "I'm home alone in the bar, you know?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 293076,
      "endMs": 294943
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "It's all me. This is, like, my bar now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 294945,
      "endMs": 297145
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Hey, cheers to you and the big game, boys, right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 297280,
      "endMs": 300765
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Really cool, too, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 300900,
      "endMs": 302167
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Those, like, those uniforms look really cool on you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 302169,
      "endMs": 304302
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "You guys look, like, really strong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 304371,
      "endMs": 306504
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "I am a little bored.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 309610,
      "endMs": 311977
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "What the heck?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 316850,
      "endMs": 318700
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Hello?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 319903,
      "endMs": 321836
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Hello?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 322939,
      "endMs": 324806
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Mac?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 325674,
      "endMs": 326808
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Dee?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 327771,
      "endMs": 329677
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Frank?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329746,
      "endMs": 331679
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Is this a joke?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 331748,
      "endMs": 333882
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Cricket?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 336036,
      "endMs": 337635
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Uncle Jack?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 337671,
      "endMs": 339237
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Is this a joke?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 339372,
      "endMs": 340731
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "It's only my imagination.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 343377,
      "endMs": 344909
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "It's only my imagination. It's only my imagination.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 344978,
      "endMs": 347646
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 355939,
      "endMs": 357405
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "So, he tries to punch me. He misses.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 357540,
      "endMs": 360141
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Oh. He misses. What an idiot, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 360143,
      "endMs": 362076
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 362112,
      "endMs": 362866
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "I got it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 363580,
      "endMs": 364679
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Hey, idiot. What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 371037,
      "endMs": 373037
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Read the sign.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 373073,
      "endMs": 374973
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "\"Closed for salmonella because Super Bowl.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 374975,
      "endMs": 377976
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Well, which one is it? Is it closed for salmonella,",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 378111,
      "endMs": 379778
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "or is it closed for the Super Bowl? I don't know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 379780,
      "endMs": 381712
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Burglars.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 382329,
      "endMs": 383447
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Thi-This is my bar.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 385669,
      "endMs": 387268
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "I have to defend it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 389006,
      "endMs": 390538
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Ah, I know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 394227,
      "endMs": 395676
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "_",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 434184,
      "endMs": 439555
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Ooh, ooh, that's a gusher.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 465882,
      "endMs": 468166
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "I got to stop the bleeding.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 468301,
      "endMs": 470034
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Help! Help!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 470641,
      "endMs": 472170
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Oh, shit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 475446,
      "endMs": 476841
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Uh, okay. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 478578,
      "endMs": 480845
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Oh, God. Oh, this is gonna suck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 490740,
      "endMs": 493407
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Oh! Shit!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 495579,
      "endMs": 497411
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 499316,
      "endMs": 500732
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "It's time for the Super Bowl. Super Bowl.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 523640,
      "endMs": 526907
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Oh, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 529112,
      "endMs": 530645
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 535404,
      "endMs": 536601
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "How is the game starting? Uh...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 537904,
      "endMs": 540271
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "How did I lose an entire day?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 540406,
      "endMs": 542740
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Oh, shit, I got to get the TV on!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 542742,
      "endMs": 545009
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Oh, shit. Hey, uh, help?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 549082,
      "endMs": 550748
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Oh, who am I kidding, man?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 552006,
      "endMs": 553167
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "No one's gonna leave their TVs right now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 553170,
      "endMs": 555503
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "My colors.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 557774,
      "endMs": 560308
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "I-I didn't do my color rituals. Guys, you're gonna lose the game because of me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 560443,
      "endMs": 565246
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "I'm so sorry I let you guy...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 565282,
      "endMs": 567315
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "I let you guys down, man. I didn't...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 567317,
      "endMs": 569600
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Oh, I blew it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 569603,
      "endMs": 571361
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "It's gonna be my fault.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571938,
      "endMs": 573838
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Hey. Hey there, fella. Whoa, whoa, whoa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 579212,
      "endMs": 582013
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Be careful. Don't-don't... don't go by the traps.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 582082,
      "endMs": 585112
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Don't... Come here, come here, come here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 585147,
      "endMs": 586300
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Come here, come here, come here. Come here. I got you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 586369,
      "endMs": 588703
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "You're gonna be okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 588772,
      "endMs": 590078
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "'Cause I know what it's like to be caught in a trap now, and it's not okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 590674,
      "endMs": 594041
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "I won't let you get caught in a trap, okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 594110,
      "endMs": 596777
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "You're so cute and tiny and...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 596813,
      "endMs": 599647
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "and brown.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 601349,
      "endMs": 602233
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Healthy-looking fellow, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 605338,
      "endMs": 607438
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Ah. The brown is down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 619102,
      "endMs": 621101
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "The brown is down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 621137,
      "endMs": 623438
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Wasn't too bad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 623440,
      "endMs": 625039
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Eagles must have scored. It's working!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 627143,
      "endMs": 629510
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "All right. All right, let's get that TV on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 629546,
      "endMs": 631779
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "I ate my brown, and it worked!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 635134,
      "endMs": 637267
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "I ate my brown!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 637304,
      "endMs": 639470
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Although I got a feeling that's gonna come back to haunt me later.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 643310,
      "endMs": 646811
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "No, right now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 648348,
      "endMs": 650348
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Never, ever, ever, ever, ever eat a rat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654571,
      "endMs": 657372
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Oh, man, that sounds like the Pats scored, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 673406,
      "endMs": 675873
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Okay, I-I just got to keep going with my colors, right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 676009,
      "endMs": 678609
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "All right, that's what I'm gonna do. I'm-I'm gonna keep going.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 678611,
      "endMs": 680812
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "I'm gonna... I'm gonna wear green.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 680947,
      "endMs": 682747
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "I'm gonna drink yellow. All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 682749,
      "endMs": 685099
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Green. What's-what's green? What's green?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 685135,
      "endMs": 686834
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "What can I...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 686969,
      "endMs": 689437
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Okay, I got it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 689439,
      "endMs": 690838
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Okay, boys, I got it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 690874,
      "endMs": 692573
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Here's the play.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 692609,
      "endMs": 693975
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "I'm not gonna let you fellas down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 693977,
      "endMs": 695860
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "I'm gonna untie my shoes, I'm gonna toss them over the rope.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 695912,
      "endMs": 700381
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "That's gonna lower that green paint can down to me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 700383,
      "endMs": 703134
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Shoes goes up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 712078,
      "endMs": 714478
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Soar like an Eagle!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 714514,
      "endMs": 716681
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Aah! Okay, boys, I'm not gonna let you down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 716683,
      "endMs": 721502
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Soar like an Eagle! Yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 721504,
      "endMs": 724438
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Oh, shit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 733915,
      "endMs": 736401
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Okay, plan B.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 736536,
      "endMs": 738736
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Oh, no. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 740173,
      "endMs": 742874
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Bear with me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 743922,
      "endMs": 744675
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 745690,
      "endMs": 746543
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Let's chew through this bad boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 746579,
      "endMs": 748346
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "I'm gonna chew through it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 748348,
      "endMs": 749814
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "There we go. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 754704,
      "endMs": 756904
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Here we go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 756973,
      "endMs": 759307
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Oh, no.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760643,
      "endMs": 763378
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 763513,
      "endMs": 764979
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "I'm just gonna have to catch it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 765114,
      "endMs": 766647
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "One... two... three.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 766716,
      "endMs": 771102
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Okay, I'm green.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 788705,
      "endMs": 790371
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "That's...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 791830,
      "endMs": 792908
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Nice. Sounds like it's working.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 793176,
      "endMs": 795242
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 795311,
      "endMs": 796577
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Got to get some yellow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 796646,
      "endMs": 797903
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Got to get some yellow! Got to drink some beers, boys!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 799382,
      "endMs": 802349
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "I'm coming, beer!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 811477,
      "endMs": 812409
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "I'm gonna get my yellow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 812445,
      "endMs": 814212
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Oh, shit!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 821242,
      "endMs": 823704
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "I'm stuck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 824130,
      "endMs": 825506
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 852135,
      "endMs": 854101
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Not enough yellow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 866649,
      "endMs": 868098
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Where the hell am I gonna get some yellow?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 869602,
      "endMs": 871802
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "Oh, God.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 875341,
      "endMs": 876908
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Oh, God.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 877010,
      "endMs": 879677
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Oh, this is awful.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882397,
      "endMs": 883547
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "You can do it, Charlie. You drink that yellow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 883616,
      "endMs": 886234
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "You got us here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 887370,
      "endMs": 888502
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Now finish what you started.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 888571,
      "endMs": 889904
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Whoa. Hey, dudes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 890039,
      "endMs": 892239
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Finish your color rituals.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 892242,
      "endMs": 893974
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Okay. Here goes!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 894043,
      "endMs": 895309
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Go, Eagles!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 895311,
      "endMs": 897778
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Oh, that was rough.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 899549,
      "endMs": 901531
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Now turn on that TV.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 901568,
      "endMs": 902666
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 902735,
      "endMs": 903734
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 903803,
      "endMs": 905336
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "I don't think I can get there, boys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 905338,
      "endMs": 907939
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "You watched every game this season... you can't miss the end of the most important one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908074,
      "endMs": 910474
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Oh, come on, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 910510,
      "endMs": 911675
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "I did the color rituals. Isn't that enough?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 911711,
      "endMs": 913677
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "The only reason the Eagles made it this far is because of your superstitions.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 913713,
      "endMs": 917081
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "The rituals. They say you're caught in a bear trap.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 917083,
      "endMs": 919500
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "They say you lost two quarts of blood.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 919502,
      "endMs": 921301
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "They say you're hallucinating!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 921337,
      "endMs": 922570
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Who's \"they\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 922639,
      "endMs": 923904
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Everyone who didn't believe in you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 923907,
      "endMs": 925506
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "And I got two words for them: (bleep) 'em!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 925508,
      "endMs": 927708
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Right! You've got this, Charlie. You're an Eagle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 927843,
      "endMs": 930578
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Yeah! Now go turn on that TV!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 930647,
      "endMs": 932512
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Yeah! Here I go!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 932549,
      "endMs": 935399
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Yeah, come on, Charlie. You got this. Come on, Charlie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 935468,
      "endMs": 936600
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Come on, Charlie. Come on! Pull that chain! Pull it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 941140,
      "endMs": 942873
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944477,
      "endMs": 945253
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Come on, Charlie. You can do this, baby. Let's go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 946212,
      "endMs": 948946
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Oh, glass!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 949081,
      "endMs": 950948
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "I stepped right on the glass! Yeah,",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 951083,
      "endMs": 953300
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "but keep pushing, man. No pain, no gain!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 953303,
      "endMs": 954702
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Okay. I got it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 954837,
      "endMs": 956237
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Oh! Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 958308,
      "endMs": 959315
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "I forgot about that one!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 960743,
      "endMs": 962709
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Why would anybody do that to anybody?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 962745,
      "endMs": 964578
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "Fight through it. Fight through the pain!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 964614,
      "endMs": 966635
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Come on, come on. Move, move.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 966649,
      "endMs": 968866
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Oh, I forgot...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 969001,
      "endMs": 970262
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Oh! Shit!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 970603,
      "endMs": 972120
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Come on, man. You got it. You took that one, eh? Keep going, Charlie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 972605,
      "endMs": 975782
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Come on, Charlie. Pull that chain!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 977410,
      "endMs": 979076
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Pull that chain! Pull that chain! I am pulling,",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 979145,
      "endMs": 980277
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "you big fat assholes! Pull that chain!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980280,
      "endMs": 982146
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "There's some slack in here. Pull it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982215,
      "endMs": 983747
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "There you go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 984042,
      "endMs": 985299
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Come on, Charlie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985434,
      "endMs": 987567
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "I can't do it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 988292,
      "endMs": 989569
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "I can't do it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 990832,
      "endMs": 991571
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "No, no, it's too hard.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 991608,
      "endMs": 994041
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "No, the trap. It was designed for animals.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 994043,
      "endMs": 996310
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Yeah. So?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 996379,
      "endMs": 997778
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "You're a human, dude.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 998920,
      "endMs": 1000047
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "Use your thumbs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1000116,
      "endMs": 1001999
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "What do you mean, use my thumbs? There's a release lever on the bottom. Thumbs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1002134,
      "endMs": 1006404
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "What?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1006999,
      "endMs": 1008606
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Well, why didn't you tell me there was a release lever?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1008608,
      "endMs": 1011742
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "You bought the trap, Charlie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1011877,
      "endMs": 1013744
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "I only know about the release lever because you know about the release lever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1013879,
      "endMs": 1017481
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Y-You get that, right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1017517,
      "endMs": 1019166
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "Yeah, no, I-I totally get that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1019168,
      "endMs": 1022436
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "He's not getting it. We're-we're not real. - No, I get it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1022472,
      "endMs": 1024104
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Quick question: where is the release lever?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1024173,
      "endMs": 1027240
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "It's on the bottom! It's on the bottom!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1027276,
      "endMs": 1028976
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "The bottom of the trap. Yeah. You set it up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1029111,
      "endMs": 1030244
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "I see it. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1030246,
      "endMs": 1032247
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1035401,
      "endMs": 1036466
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "Patriots with the ball at their own",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1040073,
      "endMs": 1041338
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "nine yard line. Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1041407,
      "endMs": 1043207
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "Oh, Brady's got the ball. The ball... What?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1043209,
      "endMs": 1046076
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "Brady's got the ball with time on the clock!?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1046112,
      "endMs": 1047811
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "Oh, shit, what happened? What changed?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1047847,
      "endMs": 1050014
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "Yeah... you're gonna",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050016,
      "endMs": 1051565
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "have to get back in that trap. Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1051601,
      "endMs": 1052900
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "Aw, come on, man. You just told me to get out of it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1053035,
      "endMs": 1056103
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "Yeah, that was before Brady had the ball.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1056239,
      "endMs": 1058372
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "Does it have to be the same leg or...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1058968,
      "endMs": 1060441
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "Yeah. Same leg. - Damn it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1060510,
      "endMs": 1062710
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "Are you sure this is gonna work?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1062712,
      "endMs": 1064712
    },
    {
      "index": 286,
      "text": "Every single thing that every fan does, at home or at the stadium, makes a direct impact in the game.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1064781,
      "endMs": 1070267
    },
    {
      "index": 287,
      "text": "Aw... shit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1070403,
      "endMs": 1072936
    },
    {
      "index": 288,
      "text": "_",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1072972,
      "endMs": 1074572
    },
    {
      "index": 289,
      "text": "synced and corrected by sot26 - www.addic7ed.com",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1116949,
      "endMs": 1119048
    }
  ],
